# UX Assets

Interface design assets for the AR indoor navigation app, exported as PNG.

* **Figma file:** [AR Project](https://www.figma.com/design/mXjZJhPeFX0A18XrPsHrvZ/AR-Project?node-id=210-1120)
* The PNGs in this folder cover the destination selection screen, the AR route overlay (path, directional arrow, destination pin) and the room information overlay.
* Designed by Favour Mokwenye.
